MyLinux kernel integration
==========================

The platform source tree is separate from the kernel source.

Current development kernel:
    $HOME/roms/kernel/samsung/gto

This directory is reserved for integration metadata and build
configuration. It is not a copy of the kernel source.

Before building a boot image, validate:
- target architecture and board configuration
- kernel configuration
- device tree and boot image format
- vendor dependencies
- Android kernel interface compatibility
